"about.body"             = "Aura is a weather app for iPhone and Apple Watch. It takes your nearest location and shows you the AEMET forecast in full color: in the app itself, in the widgets and in the Lock Screen and watch complications. It updates on its own as the data changes.\n\nFrom the Latin aura: a breeze, air in motion, and also the halo of light around something.\n\nThe data comes from open-data repositories with public access: AEMET, MITECO and Copernicus. Aura is an independent app: it isn’t affiliated with AEMET, MITECO or any government body, and doesn’t represent them. Everything happens on your device: no account and no servers of my own; it only connects to those sources to bring in the data.";
